# rows-typed (H4): "2.5" typed into a's field, Enter not pressed — the box
# shows the draft, the URL is unchanged.
# Coordinates are this tree's (the function card is 104 tall without
# the readout): row a/k/b/h at y 277/321/382/426. h4-readout grows the
# function card by 133.5, landing rows at the reference y; flip back then.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 331 299
wait 150
key a ctrl
wait 100
type "2.5"
wait 200
shot rows-typed
